@gameApi = http://localhost:5001
@accessToken = replace-with-an-access-token-from-the-auth-api
@ticketId = replace-with-a-ticket-id

### Join the matchmaking queue
POST {{gameApi}}/api/matchmaking/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Check queue or match status
GET {{gameApi}}/api/matchmaking/tickets/{{ticketId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Cancel a queue or unconsumed match ticket
DELETE {{gameApi}}/api/matchmaking/tickets/{{ticketId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Confirm that the HTTP API is running
GET {{gameApi}}/health
